WEBVTT

00:00:57.845 --> 00:01:02.642
Our data shows that one in three women
are considering leaving the workforce

00:01:02.642 --> 00:01:03.851
in the next year.

00:01:04.185 --> 00:01:06.187
Deepa Purushothaman: One in three.

00:01:06.229 --> 00:01:08.731
RG: And when we consider

00:01:08.773 --> 00:01:13.986
all of the backs and shoulders
that we've stood on to get here,

00:01:14.028 --> 00:01:15.655
corporate America,

00:01:15.696 --> 00:01:17.907
women of color allies,

00:01:17.949 --> 00:01:20.326
are y'all ready for us to leave?

00:01:20.368 --> 00:01:22.703
When it comes to the world of work,

00:01:22.703 --> 00:01:26.040
I describe Deepa and I
as corporate refugees.

00:01:26.082 --> 00:01:27.875
Thirty years ago,

00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:29.210
I was an only,

00:01:29.252 --> 00:01:32.255
a Black woman in the specialty
chemicals industry,